# /staticfiles is the collectstatic BUILD OUTPUT (STATIC_ROOT) — ignored.
# /static is the hand-authored SOURCE (STATICFILES_DIRS: app.css, app.js)
# and must stay tracked; it was previously (and wrongly) ignored here too,
# meaning the entire design system was never actually in version control.
/staticfiles

